WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.971
Your steering wheel hides an explosive.

00:00:02.981 --> 00:00:04.894
A sensor feels the crash.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:06.927
Normal braking won't trigger it.

00:00:06.937 --> 00:00:08.934
It ignites a charge that makes a

00:00:08.944 --> 00:00:11.475
flood of mostly nitrogen gas.

00:00:11.485 --> 00:00:13.144
The bag is full in a few

00:00:13.154 --> 00:00:14.676
hundredths of a second.

00:00:14.686 --> 00:00:16.338
So why isn't it like hitting a

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:17.142
wall?

00:00:17.152 --> 00:00:18.263
It has holes.

00:00:18.273 --> 00:00:20.338
As you press in, the gas escapes

00:00:20.348 --> 00:00:22.002
and the bag goes soft.

00:00:22.012 --> 00:00:24.104
By the time the car stops, it's

00:00:24.114 --> 00:00:25.739
mostly deflated.
